  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gendered political economy analysis on the civil society landscape</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International and national technical expertise will be commissioned to undertake a gendered Political Economy Analysis (PEA) of the civil society landscape in our selected provinces and provide recommendations to inform programming. The research will focus on women and girls&#x2019; participation and leadership in informal politics, power dynamics and public life, as well as mapping the civil society groups and dynamics between them. The research will also analyse drivers of fragility in Kasai, including social exclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
